    "description": "<p>Coiled like a serpent and rooted like stone, you become a weapon of patience and explosive precision. This form teaches that stillness can be deadlier than motion.</p>\n<p>You coil low and strike with deceptive reach. Whilst in this form, you gain the following modifiers:</p>\n<ul><li>When attacking from reach, gain +Int mod as precision damage.</li><li>You gain advantage on all Kip up (Acrobatics) actions.</li></ul>\n<p><em>Automated:</em> press Combat Form's Use to enter it (1 AP, a stance). +Int damage on a melee Strike beyond 5 feet (applied as damage, which a creature immune to precision still takes), and advantage on Kip Up. All its modifiers are class bonuses.</p>",
